Cell["\<\
docs/FRAMEWORK-2026-07-13.md (the layer/hypothesis architecture, Layer-3 \
ledger parsed live in S9); docs/COMPLETE-THEORY-2026-07-13.md; \
05-CERT-epsilon-certificates/CONVERGENCE-ANALYSIS-2026-07-13.md.\
